# Container tools: an optional stage, shipped as a system extension image
# and enabled with pos-stage (BUILD.md "Container stage"). It requires the
# network stage: netavark writes its firewall rules with nft.
# The OCI runtime (crun; json-c is core-libs'), the container monitor
# (conmon) and the init of pods and --init (catatonit).
crun
conmon
catatonit
# Networks: rootless containers through pasta (passt), rootful bridges with
# netavark, name resolution with aardvark-dns.
passt
netavark
aardvark-dns
# podman (with podman-remote and the docker command) and the configuration
# it reads.
containers-common
podman
# Images: buildah builds them, skopeo copies and inspects them in
# registries. toolbox: interactive development containers.
buildah
skopeo
toolbox
